Package: orrery-wallpaper
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Fadi Q <fadi.qazzazee@gmail.com>
Depends: gjs, gir1.2-gtk-4.0
Recommends: gir1.2-gtk4layershell-1.0
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/fqazzazee/orrery
Description: Live solar system wallpaper for KDE, XFCE, Cinnamon, MATE, Sway and more
 Orrery for desktops other than GNOME Shell (which has its own extension):
 the solar system as it is right now, with the planets turned the way they
 really face, their moons, and the spacecraft of the space age on their real
 paths. "orrery-wallpaper daemon" keeps the wallpaper up to date on KDE
 Plasma, XFCE, Cinnamon, MATE, Budgie, LXQt, Sway and Hyprland;
 "orrery-wallpaper live" is an animated background on Wayland compositors
 with layer-shell.
